      "reasoning": "Personally inspected both complete frozen recipes, successful TOGO provider records and original NBRC1004/1390 ingredient tables. Both explicitly name desiccated ox bile at8g input, while their other ingredients differ. The C-authored promotion preserves this dried biological material using a local identity with broader ox-bile grounding and does not assign a manufacturer, commercial grade, chemical composition or whole-medium equality. Actual Desicatted_Ox-bile, Ox-bile and Oxgall candidates were inspected; no merge is approved."
