      "reasoning": "Personally inspected all three complete frozen recipes, DSMZ1113 primary PDF and MediaDive2234 source JSON. Original source distinguishes100ml EMJH enrichment from2.3g EMJH base. Frozen derivatives instead carry100 G_PER_L twice and100 PERCENT_V_V once; the final corrected decision explicitly retains those quantity conflicts. Manufacturer-authored Difco/BBL manual supports albumin/Tween80 plus unspecified growth factors, so the C-authored enrichment with PARTIAL composition is supported without albumin species, component amounts, exact historical vendor-version equality or whole-base conflation."
